# Implementation Plan - Phase 5: Risk, Legal & Compliance

# Goal Description
Implement the non-negotiable regulatory and risk controls. This includes a hard-coded "Fraud Engine" to detect velocity abuse, dynamic Tax Calculation for Canadian provinces (GST/HST/QST), and the generation of authoritative bilingual legal documents.

## User Review Required
> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Tax Logic**:
> We will implement a `TaxService` that calculates based on **Consumer Location**.
> - ON: 13% HST
> - QC: 5% GST + 9.975% QST
> - AB: 5% GST
> - **Exemptions**: Basic groceries (Zero-rated). We need a `taxCode` on products to support this.

> [!WARNING]
> **Legal Documents**:
> I will generate the **English** versions of the Terms of Service and Privacy Policy based on the Master Prompt's requirements (Quebec Law 25, PIPEDA).
> *Note: French translations will be placeholders marked [FR] for this iteration unless fully generated.*

